Rule 7 (If size is specified, scale_factor cannot be specified, and vice versa)
{v_1 : int ⊎ tuple(int) ⊎ list(int), v_2 : float ⊎ tuple(float) ⊎ list(float)} |= if v_1 > 0 then v_2 ≤ 0
